Q2. Employee Salary Analysis: Write a Python program using Pandas to read employee details from employee.csv. Display each employee’s name, department, and salary, then calculate and display the average salary for each department.

import pandas as pd

# Read employee data from the CSV file
employees = pd.read_csv("employee.csv")

# Display employee names, departments, and salaries
print("Employee Details:")
print(employees[["Name", "Department", "Salary"]].to_string(index=False))

# Calculate and display average salary by department
print("\nAverage Salary by Department:")
average_salary = employees.groupby("Department")["Salary"].mean()
print(average_salary)
